@startuml campaign-lifecycle-state
title Campaign Lifecycle | UML State Machine
hide empty description
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam stateBackgroundColor white
skinparam noteBackgroundColor white
top to bottom direction

state DRAFT
state READY_FOR_DISCOVERY
state ACTIVE
state COMPLETED
state CLOSED
state ARCHIVED

[*] --> DRAFT : / create campaign
DRAFT --> READY_FOR_DISCOVERY : changeStatus(READY_FOR_DISCOVERY)\n[required brief fields present (BR-11/12)]\n/ save M3 snapshot and enqueue embedding
DRAFT --> ARCHIVED : archive() or changeStatus(ARCHIVED)\n[allowed from DRAFT (BR-12)] / archive campaign
READY_FOR_DISCOVERY --> ACTIVE : changeStatus(ACTIVE)\n[allowed from READY_FOR_DISCOVERY (BR-12)] / activate campaign
ACTIVE --> COMPLETED : changeStatus(COMPLETED)\n[at least one COMPLETED collaboration; no unfinished\ncollaborations or open deals (BR-12)] / complete campaign
READY_FOR_DISCOVERY --> CLOSED : changeStatus(CLOSED)\n[closure conditions met] / record reason and closed_at
ACTIVE --> CLOSED : changeStatus(CLOSED)\n[closure conditions met] / record reason and closed_at
COMPLETED --> [*]
CLOSED --> [*]
ARCHIVED --> [*]

note right of CLOSED
  Closure requires zero COMPLETED collaborations,
  no unfinished collaborations, no CONTACTED or
  NEGOTIATING deals and a nonblank reason.
end note
note left of DRAFT
  Status changes require the authorized owner,
  CHANGE_CAMPAIGN_STATUS and current If-Match.
  prepareForRecommendation() can also move a
  DRAFT to READY_FOR_DISCOVERY after the
  same checks, with RUN_RECOMMENDATION.
end note
@enduml
